  "id": "P09",
  "kind": "phonics",
  "title": {
    "nl": "a · b · c · 1–20",
    "zh": "字母表、拼读、数字 1–20",
    "en": "The alphabet, spelling, numbers 1–20"
  },
  "nn_lessons": ["NN20", "NN01"],
  "reading": "NN18",
  "sounds": [
    {
      "grapheme": "a e i o u",
      "note_zh": "元音字母的名字就是它的长音：a = aa，e = ee，i = ie，o = oo，u = uu。y 叫“i-grec”，也常读成 ij。拼名字时最容易混的是 e 和 i：e 读“诶”，i 读“衣”。",
      "note_en": "Vowel letters are named by their long sound: a = aa, e = ee, i = ie, o = oo, u = uu; y is 'i-grec', often said like ij.",
      "word_ids": ["w_letter_a", "w_letter_e", "w_letter_i", "w_letter_o", "w_letter_u", "w_letter_y"]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "-ee",
      "note_zh": "b c d g j p t v w：名字都是“辅音 + ee”：bee、cee、dee、gee、jee、pee、tee、vee、wee。c 读 see（在 e、i 前读 s，如 cent），g 是喉音，j 读 jee，不是英语的 jay。",
      "note_en": "b c d g j p t v w are 'consonant + ee': bee, cee (said 'see'), dee, gee (throaty g), jee, pee, tee, vee, wee.",
      "word_ids": [
        "w_letter_b",
        "w_letter_c",
        "w_letter_d",
        "w_letter_g",
        "w_letter_j",
        "w_letter_p",
        "w_letter_t",
        "w_letter_v",
        "w_letter_w"
      ]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "e-",
      "note_zh": "f l m n r s：名字都是“e + 辅音”：ef、el、em、en、er、es。前面的 e 是短 e，像 mes 里的 e。",
      "note_en": "f l m n r s are 'e + consonant': ef, el, em, en, er, es, with the short e of mes.",
      "word_ids": ["w_letter_f", "w_letter_l", "w_letter_m", "w_letter_n", "w_letter_r", "w_letter_s"]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "h k q x z",
      "note_zh": "其余五个：h = haa，k = kaa，q = kuu（uu 是长 ü），x = iks，z = zet。",
      "note_en": "The other five: h = haa, k = kaa, q = kuu, x = iks, z = zet.",
      "word_ids": ["w_letter_h", "w_letter_k", "w_letter_q", "w_letter_x", "w_letter_z"]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "1–10",
      "note_zh": "1–10：één（“一”）上面有两个重音符（é），和冠词 een（一个）区分；acht 的 ch、negen 的 g 都是喉音；zeven 的 z 是浊音，像轻轻的“z”。",
      "note_en": "1–10: één carries accents to tell it from the article een; ch in acht and g in negen are throaty.",
      "word_ids": [
        "w_een_telw",
        "w_twee",
        "w_drie",
        "w_vier",
        "w_vijf",
        "w_zes",
        "w_zeven",
        "w_acht",
        "w_negen",
        "w_tien"
      ]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "11–20",
      "note_zh": "11、12 是 elf、twaalf；13–19 是“个位 + tien”，注意 dertien、veertien（不是 drietien、viertien）；20 是 twintig。",
      "note_en": "11 and 12 are elf, twaalf; 13–19 are 'unit + tien' — note dertien and veertien; 20 is twintig.",
      "word_ids": [
